From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aeryn Moss <aerynm@google.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:32:10 -0700
Subject: [a11y] Defer restoring parents of aria-owned children during removal

When an aria-owns owner is removed while immediate tree updates are
allowed, AXRelationCache::RemoveAXID() previously called
MaybeRestoreParentOfOwnedChild() -> RestoreParentOrPruneWithCleanLayout()
synchronously during removal. Restoring the child's parent inline can
trigger ChildrenChangedWithCleanLayout() and nested relation updates
that rebuild or clear an ancestor's children vector while
RemoveSubtree() is still iterating over it.

Instead, record unparented aria-owns children in
child_axids_to_restore_parent_ (and queue candidate owners in
owner_axids_to_update_) during RemoveAXID(), and restore or prune their
parents later in AXRelationCache::ProcessUpdatesWithCleanLayout() after
pending owner updates have been processed.

In AXObjectCacheImpl, flush deferred parent restorations as soon as the
outermost Remove(), RemoveSubtree(), or RemoveIncludedSubtree() call
completes, and defer radio button peer invalidation during immediate
tree updates so ancestor subtrees and unparented nodes are not touched
mid-removal.

Includes web tests and WPT crashtests for aria-owns parent restoration
from crrev.com/c/8614312.

Co-authored-by: Sky Debreuil <skydebreuil@google.com>
Fixed: 572237022
Change-Id: I1a75b0b9fbede0533df92dacf3fdcfb9b2f7eae7
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8594503
Reviewed-by: Lucas Radaelli <lucasradaelli@google.com>
Commit-Queue: Aeryn Moss <aerynm@google.com>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1723783}

Electron adaptation notes (43-x-y):
This branch predates the ARIA radiogroup refactors
(aria_radiogroups_with_changed_membership_, MarkAriaRadioGroupMembersDirty(),
queued_children_changed_ancestors_, bool-returning
UpdateAriaOwnsWithCleanLayout()). The deferred radio-button peer set is drained
by a new MarkDirtyRadioButtonPeers() helper called from CommitAXUpdates() right
after ProcessUpdatesWithCleanLayout(). ProcessUpdatesWithCleanLayout() keeps
this branch's single-batch owner processing and gains RestorePendingParents()
before the batch and after each owner. RemoveIncludedSubtree() keeps
GuardedCachedChildrenIncludingIgnored(). MapOwnedChildrenWithCleanLayout() only
gains the owner->IsDetached() early return (the UpdateChildrenIfNecessary()
call does not exist here). base/auto_reset.h is included in
ax_relation_cache.cc. Test changes were not carried.

